# Keep the build context small and reproducible: everything below is either
# rebuilt inside the image or should never leave the host.
# spore-photos-client/public/apk/ is NOT ignored — drop an APK there before
# building and it ships with the image.
.git
.gitignore
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
spore-photos-mobile
docs
*.md
.env
.env.*
config/spore-photos.config.json
docker/.env
library
data
*.log